This package reads and writes DDS texture data and includes our JavaScript
port of libsquish 1.15 for BC1-BC5 encoding.
CarbonEngine and Fenris Creations (CCP Games) are mentioned for
interoperability, provenance, and future migration context only. This package is
not affiliated with or endorsed by CCP Games.



Our JavaScript port lives in `src/resource/formats/dds/core/libsquish.js`, with
its single-colour lookup tables in `squishSingleColourLookup.js`. All ten
Carbon compressor modes use this MIT implementation. No id Software encoder
code is included.

Source: https://sourceforge.net/projects/libsquish/files/libsquish-1.15.tgz

